    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1538">

                <pb facs="1153" n="1037" xml:id="pg1037"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.52/564.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Consul Canada to the
                            Secretary of State</hi>.<anchor n="95"
                        xml:id="d1538-f1"/>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 1167.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Consulate</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Vera Cruz</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-03-08">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">March 8, 1915</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to refer to the
                    Department’s December 18, 1913,<anchor n="96" xml:id="d1538-f2"/> and to
                    transmit enclosed herewith two replies of the Constitutionalist Foreign Office
                    to a note in which this Consulate stated it would be grateful for any action
                    that the Constitutionalist Government might see fit to take in order to offer
                    guaranties to merchandise stored, while enroute to Puebla, in the house of Sr.
                    Victoriano García, a Spanish subject, and reported as being disposed of by
                    General Alvarado. The Spanish Minister in Mexico City had instructed the Spanish
                    Consul at this port to request the cooperation of this Consulate in the
                    matter.</p>
                <p>I have [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Wm. W. Canada.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>



                <xi:include href="d1538-a1.xml" xpointer="d1538-a1"/>
                <xi:include href="d1538-a2.xml" xpointer="d1538-a2"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
